# Sum 10+9+...+1 using subtraction, scratch memory and conditional branches.
.entry add
add: subleq counter scratch next
next: subleq scratch sum clear
clear: subleq scratch scratch decrement
decrement: subleq one counter done
jump: subleq zero zero add
done: subleq sum -1 0
stop: .halt
counter: .word 10
sum: .word 0
scratch: .word 0
one: .word 1
zero: .word 0
